  "title": "Lemon Garlic Shrimp with Roasted Brussels Sprouts and Brown Rice",
  "description": "Shrimp roasted in a lemon garlic sauce are piled over brown rice and served with Brussels sprouts in this easy all-in-one weeknight meal.",
  "authors": [
    "SlimCookins"
  ],
